# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# HOW TO USE
#   1. Copy this file to `.env.local`  →  cp .env.example .env.local
#   2. Paste your REAL values into .env.local (never into this file).
#   3. .env.local is gitignored — it never gets committed.
#   4. For the live site, add the same names + values in the
#      Vercel dashboard → Settings → Environment Variables.
#
# NEVER paste a real key into a chat or commit .env.local.
# This file only lists NAMES + placeholders, so it's safe to commit.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Contact form → email notification (Resend). Get a key at https://resend.com
RESEND_API_KEY=
